    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. yeah i've been icing it and keeping it up on a pillow. it still feels a little tight though, almost like a dull ache. do you think i should take some ibuprofen for the inflammation or is that overkill for just a strain?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
