      "content": "idk i'm just worried it might be something more than a strain, but im kinda dreading going to the clinic for something that might just be a minor thing. i don't want to waste their time if i can just handle it here. honestly it's a bit red too, but that probably just means there's extra blood flow to the area to help it heal, right? i think i'll just keep icing it and maybe take a couple of ibuprofen and see how i feel tomorrow.",
